WEBVTT

00:11.050 --> 00:15.390
Daa! Daa! Daa!

00:11.310 --> 00:15.180
Mukai awase ni suwatta shunkan ni

00:11.310 --> 00:15.180
The moment we sat facing each other

00:15.650 --> 00:19.970
otona no yokogao ni DOKI DOKI shiteru no

00:15.650 --> 00:19.970
my heart was thumping at the sideways view of your adult-like face

00:20.320 --> 00:24.060
Itsudemo soba ni iru hazu demo

00:20.320 --> 00:24.060
Although you're always beside me

00:24.360 --> 00:28.730
hontou wa KIMI no koto yoku shiranai yo ne

00:24.360 --> 00:28.730
the truth is I don't really know much about you

00:28.910 --> 00:37.450
Itsumo nakamatachi to asonderu kedo

00:28.910 --> 00:37.450
We're always playing with our friends

00:37.630 --> 00:43.290
futarikiri ni naru to doko ka chigau yo

00:37.630 --> 00:43.290
but when we're alone, something's different

00:43.880 --> 00:46.830
Nanika hanashi kakete

00:43.880 --> 00:46.830
Talk to me about something

00:47.550 --> 00:51.960
Zutto dare yori mo daisuki da yo

00:47.550 --> 00:51.960
I've always loved you more than anyone else

00:52.020 --> 00:56.300
dakedo ienai yo chikasugiru yo

00:52.020 --> 00:56.300
but I can't say it, you're too close

00:56.440 --> 01:00.430
Itsuka kizuite yo mitsumeteru yo

00:56.440 --> 01:00.430
Someday, notice that I'm gazing at you

01:00.440 --> 01:04.890
Koi no TANE wo maitara

01:00.440 --> 01:04.890
When we plant the seeds of love

01:05.030 --> 01:09.150
hora sakasou yo ippai

01:05.030 --> 01:09.150
see, they will all bloom fully

01:09.530 --> 01:14.950
Mou kamisama ni onegai

01:09.530 --> 01:14.950
That's my wish to God

01:27.120 --> 01:28.380
Okay~ here I go!

01:33.020 --> 01:34.290
How many more laps?

01:34.680 --> 01:35.490
Three more~!

01:37.310 --> 01:39.250
Saionji-kun's so cool~

01:39.780 --> 01:41.860
He's got a totally different aura, doesn't he?

01:42.250 --> 01:44.580
Speaking of which, what are we going to do for Valentine's Day?

01:44.860 --> 01:46.430
Shall we go and buy chocolates together?

01:46.800 --> 01:47.580
Okay!

01:49.280 --> 01:53.180
<i>I wonder if Kanata-kun likes bitter chocolate, after all?</i>

01:53.460 --> 01:55.680
<i>Or maybe the cream-filled ones...</i>

01:56.280 --> 02:02.070
<i>This year, I'm definitely putting all my dreams into the chocolate I make and give it to Kanata-kun~</i>

02:06.050 --> 02:11.130
Valentine's Day in Heio Town

02:12.820 --> 02:14.370
Ah... no more for me.

02:14.940 --> 02:16.900
Santa, why are you slacking off?

02:17.140 --> 02:18.680
Isn't it just fine?

02:18.930 --> 02:21.500
What's the point of trying my best and showing off now?

02:22.140 --> 02:25.240
I won't be getting any chocolate from anyone tomorrow, anyway.

02:25.670 --> 02:26.690
What are you talking about?

02:27.000 --> 02:28.450
That's got nothing to do with soccer.

02:28.950 --> 02:31.040
Of course it has!

02:31.670 --> 02:34.170
Isn't your mother going to give you chocolates again?

02:34.690 --> 02:38.900
Show me a boy who's happy to get chocolates from only his mother...

02:39.360 --> 02:40.410
Ah- Sorry...

02:41.480 --> 02:42.460
Don't worry about it.

02:43.970 --> 02:45.240
Ah~

02:45.520 --> 02:48.910
All said and done, Kanata sure is popular...

02:49.150 --> 02:50.640
How nice for him...

02:53.170 --> 02:53.420
Huh?

02:53.880 --> 02:54.520
Sigh...

02:56.630 --> 02:57.270
Ah...

02:57.830 --> 03:03.860
I wonder if I'll receive the girls' overflowing love tomorrow...

03:04.610 --> 03:07.740
Will I be able to prepare what I'll give back on White Day on time?

03:08.130 --> 03:09.650
I'm worried, Okame-chan.

03:11.120 --> 03:12.130
Showoff...

03:15.180 --> 03:18.530
<i>Amazing, Yui-chan! 3 meters, 57 centimeters.</i>

03:19.280 --> 03:20.930
<i>I did it! A new record!</i>

03:21.390 --> 03:23.120
<i>Hey, where will we go to buy chocolates?</i>

03:23.650 --> 03:26.250
It's that time of the year and everyone's fussing about Valentine's Day.

03:26.350 --> 03:27.830
Must be hard...

03:28.350 --> 03:30.850
I'm glad we don't have to worry about it. Right?

03:32.190 --> 03:32.440
Huh?

03:33.060 --> 03:33.720
What's that about?

03:34.690 --> 03:36.160
Ah, um...

03:36.340 --> 03:38.780
Um... you know, we...

03:39.300 --> 03:41.890
...were just wondering whether we should give chocolate-

03:41.950 --> 03:42.340
What?!

03:42.710 --> 03:43.100
Huh?

03:43.670 --> 03:45.150
WHAT?!

03:47.380 --> 03:48.730
Miyu! You're too loud!

03:49.010 --> 03:50.460
Calm down, Miyu-chan!

03:51.060 --> 03:51.510
Who?

03:51.690 --> 03:52.890
Who? Who? Who? Who?!

03:53.380 --> 03:55.080
The guys you like... what kind of person are they?

03:55.760 --> 03:56.760
For me...

03:58.640 --> 04:02.510
He's called Tamara-kun, and he's in the same drama club as I am...

04:03.360 --> 04:05.040
It's the first time I heard of this.

04:05.490 --> 04:08.850
That's because I just recently became aware of it~

04:09.750 --> 04:14.280
He's very hardworking and does wonders with set construction and the like,

04:14.460 --> 04:17.570
and is like an unsung hero...

04:17.780 --> 04:19.280
It makes me feel so giddy~

04:19.920 --> 04:20.510
Hmm...

04:21.070 --> 04:22.520
And Nanami-chan? How about you?

04:23.210 --> 04:25.360
Me? Well, I...

04:26.330 --> 04:29.080
He works at the clothing shop where I work after school.

04:29.320 --> 04:31.190
His name is Tsukishima-san and he's a university student...

04:32.030 --> 04:34.740
Unfair~! I didn't hear about that either!

04:35.990 --> 04:41.810
That's because Tsukishima-san started working there just recently...

04:44.070 --> 04:47.020
You two have been keeping secrets from me...

04:47.360 --> 04:49.950
Miyu-chan, why don't you give Saionji-kun?

04:50.400 --> 04:53.630
That's right! Don't you have Saionji-kun?

04:54.010 --> 04:55.810
What~? Kanata?

04:56.020 --> 04:58.100
He'll get only obligatory chocolates from me~

04:58.890 --> 04:59.550
I knew it!

04:59.970 --> 05:02.830
Miyu-chan is also going to give Kanata-kun chocolates...

05:03.110 --> 05:08.050
Ah! More than anyone else, Miyu-chan should know Kanata-kun's likes and dislikes.

05:08.690 --> 05:12.040
If I carry out Shikada-san's plans, I'll know everything about Kanata-kun.

05:12.210 --> 05:17.610
But there's no mention of chocolate in this Saionji-sama handbook...

05:19.050 --> 05:19.760
I want to know!!!

05:20.150 --> 05:23.390
Just what kind of chocolate is Miyu-chan giving to Kanata-kun?!

05:26.390 --> 05:27.480
Let's see...

05:27.770 --> 05:31.220
Ruu-kun, Pepo, Wannya and Kanata...

05:31.510 --> 05:32.630
That'll be total of 4 chocolates.

05:33.060 --> 05:35.170
At 300 yen a piece...

05:35.310 --> 05:36.440
Ah, no, no... Ugh...

05:37.040 --> 05:39.620
This is so hard... How about 200 yen?

05:40.250 --> 05:41.560
I guess 100 yen would be fine!

05:41.950 --> 05:44.450
It's just obligatory chocolate, anyway. Plus, I don't have the money.

05:44.870 --> 05:45.190
Huh?

05:45.680 --> 05:46.740
I see!

05:47.020 --> 05:48.440
I still have that...

05:49.250 --> 05:50.340
Girls!

05:50.980 --> 05:53.970
I have something to say.

05:54.290 --> 05:59.480
If it's alright with you, why don't we make chocolates together at my place?

06:02.330 --> 06:05.930
I have the ingredients as well as the utensils all ready.

06:06.390 --> 06:11.610
I'll help you, so there's nothing to worry about.

06:12.000 --> 06:13.160
So you mean it's free?

06:13.340 --> 06:14.920
Ah~ Lucky!

06:16.460 --> 06:18.290
After School

06:18.290 --> 06:20.750
Hanakomachi House
Sweets Mansion

06:25.010 --> 06:30.060
If I make chocolates with a rival, it'll be easy to set up a countermeasure...

06:35.840 --> 06:36.090
Ah.

06:37.740 --> 06:40.070
Everyone... is here?

06:42.160 --> 06:44.380
I've already melted the chocolate!

06:49.410 --> 06:54.850
Take the ingredients in measured quantity and gently mix them like this.

06:57.040 --> 06:58.660
Aya-chan, is that a book?

06:59.010 --> 06:59.330
Yeah.

06:59.860 --> 07:03.840
This is a picture of Shakespeare's Romeo and Juliet...

07:03.990 --> 07:04.800
...but I wonder if this will do.

07:05.360 --> 07:12.100
I thought of scenes from various Japanese stories like Taketori Monogatari and Genji Monogatari,

07:12.380 --> 07:15.130
but somehow, they're all about blighted love...

07:15.840 --> 07:20.740
If only there was a story where the lovers are united in the end and live happily ever after...

07:21.370 --> 07:22.430
W-well...

07:22.680 --> 07:25.320
This is just like you, Aya, so it should be fine, I think.

07:26.270 --> 07:30.760
You're thinking of happy endings and he's a guy who loves the stage.

07:30.760 --> 07:32.060
It's just perfect, don't you think?

07:32.240 --> 07:32.940
You think so?

07:33.230 --> 07:34.420
Thank goodness...

07:34.810 --> 07:37.560
So, what are you making, Nanami-chan?

07:37.930 --> 07:40.140
Me? I'm making this.

07:40.660 --> 07:41.440
Ta-da!

07:42.470 --> 07:43.350
笹蒲鉾 = cake made of fish paste,
shaped like bamboo leaf

07:42.470 --> 07:43.350
Sasakamaboko?

07:43.930 --> 07:47.250
Wrong! That's a surf board! Surf board!

07:44.550 --> 07:46.560
Oops! Sorry...

07:48.040 --> 07:50.900
It's because Tsukishima-san's hobby is surfing.

07:51.280 --> 07:54.740
I heard him talking about it in the shop the other day.

07:55.200 --> 07:56.100
What about you, Miyu-chan?

07:56.690 --> 07:58.230
I'm making this.

07:59.110 --> 08:00.240
What is that?

08:02.210 --> 08:06.090
That's right. Now please keep it aside until it sets.

08:06.530 --> 08:07.110
Okay!

08:09.390 --> 08:12.990
<i>I wonder just what kind of wonderful chocolate Miyu-chan is making...</i>

08:14.480 --> 08:17.970
Chris-chan! What should I do next?

08:18.370 --> 08:22.440
W-well, you should mix the egg white with caster sugar and make meringue-

08:22.760 --> 08:23.820
Chris-chan!

08:24.370 --> 08:26.590
...add chocolate chips and then keep it in the refrigerator-

08:26.590 --> 08:27.970
Chris-chan!

08:28.020 --> 08:28.570
Y-yes...

08:29.170 --> 08:30.860
<i>Oh no, this is bad.</i>

08:31.210 --> 08:35.510
<i>At this rate, I won't be able to see what kind of chocolate Miyu-chan is making!</i>

08:36.660 --> 08:38.160
Chris-chan!!!

08:44.130 --> 08:46.230
Will you be able to do it that way?

08:46.660 --> 08:48.500
There must be some other way, Miyu.

08:52.800 --> 08:55.420
I think you should ask Chris-chan.

08:56.680 --> 08:58.240
What are you doing?

08:59.070 --> 09:06.050
I thought of making some chocolate like this, but it doesn't seem to be going well.

09:06.400 --> 09:09.740
So... what is the size of the chocolate that you wanted to make?

09:10.170 --> 09:11.460
You see?

09:11.550 --> 09:12.280
I see.

09:13.490 --> 09:16.250
Well, in any case, it's not that complicated.

09:16.530 --> 09:18.300
Let's make it properly, shall we?

09:18.640 --> 09:19.200
O-okay!

09:30.030 --> 09:32.240
Ugh! What's this?

09:32.240 --> 09:34.030
It's burned.

09:34.030 --> 09:35.750
How about giving it to Kurosu-kun?

09:36.230 --> 09:36.960
I see!

09:37.310 --> 09:39.780
He said no one's going to give him anything.

09:40.230 --> 09:42.530
Then... how about this one as well for Kurosu-kun?

09:42.890 --> 09:44.290
I'll give this to him, too!

09:44.640 --> 09:45.480
This one, too.

09:45.480 --> 09:46.090
This, too.

09:46.090 --> 09:46.730
And this.

09:51.230 --> 09:53.200
Well, this looks good.

09:53.550 --> 09:55.330
You're quite skilled, Miyu-chan.

09:55.750 --> 09:59.920
But... isn't this your long-eared white raccoon?

10:00.160 --> 10:01.610
Ah! Um...

10:01.890 --> 10:06.190
Well, Kanata likes it, so I thought it'd make him happy.

10:07.750 --> 10:08.630
I see...

10:09.230 --> 10:13.710
That's something only Miyu-chan who lives with Kanata-kun would know.

10:14.660 --> 10:15.900
Oh, no...

10:16.210 --> 10:20.870
The two of them cook and eat from the same pot at the same table, just like a married couple.

10:21.290 --> 10:23.370
They'll grow old together!!!

10:23.760 --> 10:25.030
No, it's not like that!

10:25.520 --> 10:27.920
Whenever we come face-to-face, we just end up fighting...

10:28.420 --> 10:30.080
Is it fine to ask you something?!

10:31.800 --> 10:34.940
Ask me anything! If I know the answer I'll tell you!

10:36.850 --> 10:37.130
Uh...

10:38.780 --> 10:42.980
I want to know what type of chocolate Kanata-kun likes.

10:43.400 --> 10:44.640
Uh... what?

10:45.170 --> 10:47.930
I want to know what type of chocolate Kanata-kun likes!

10:48.410 --> 10:49.510
Ah, chocolate, right?

10:49.750 --> 10:54.300
Er... Basically, he doesn't like sweets all that much.

10:54.590 --> 10:56.630
He likes pumpkin, though...

10:57.340 --> 10:58.920
Then, what about the chocolate you're making?

10:59.300 --> 11:01.060
Those are just for laughs.

11:01.430 --> 11:07.680
Um... Chocolates that aren't too sweet, maybe ones like Japanese sweets...

11:08.380 --> 11:10.530
Chocolate that is like Japanese sweets?

11:11.090 --> 11:12.290
I'll think about it.

11:14.370 --> 11:15.010
Phew...

11:17.450 --> 11:19.780
Chris-chan, thank you so much!

11:19.780 --> 11:21.300
You're welcome~

11:24.810 --> 11:29.070
They're all so happy. Aren't you glad, my lady?

11:29.490 --> 11:30.210
You're right.

11:30.530 --> 11:34.090
For now, I'm glad everyone was able to make their Valentine chocolates.

11:35.750 --> 11:40.130
But... I haven't made mine yet...

11:47.850 --> 11:50.460
St. Valentine's Day

11:53.490 --> 11:54.480
Pardon me for intruding.

11:58.500 --> 11:59.230
Momoka-san?

12:00.200 --> 12:03.400
Hello! My sweet darling Ruu!

12:04.400 --> 12:06.530
Oh my! Momoka-san, good morning!

12:09.050 --> 12:12.890
Koumei-chan... don't tell me you're also here to give chocolates to Ruu...

12:13.410 --> 12:14.810
Yes, that's right.

12:16.910 --> 12:18.100
Here, Ruu-kun.

12:18.470 --> 12:21.070
It's a chocolate Koumei made just for you!

12:22.020 --> 12:24.280
It's bigger than mine...

12:24.630 --> 12:27.310
Rather than it being famous, it's more like it's an inconvenience.

12:27.870 --> 12:29.220
For you too, Momoko-san. Here!

12:29.810 --> 12:31.280
You're giving me some as well?

12:31.660 --> 12:35.410
Yeah. We three are friends, right?

12:36.410 --> 12:37.620
I guess yes...

12:37.880 --> 12:40.590
And we'll always be friends, right?

12:41.750 --> 12:46.370
I wonder if I should give her something on White Day?

12:46.890 --> 12:50.590
Ah... Ruu-chama's been much in demand since morning.

12:51.120 --> 12:53.770
Kanata-san too has a lot of fans.

12:54.400 --> 12:58.990
I guess I won't be getting any Valentine Day chocolate from anyone.

12:59.660 --> 13:02.830
It's one of the customs practiced on Earth...

13:03.680 --> 13:07.010
Ah! But maybe Miyu-san will give me one...

13:12.960 --> 13:14.360
You ate it all!

13:14.750 --> 13:20.180
The chocolates that I put so much effort into making yesterday are all eaten up!

13:21.330 --> 13:22.480
Pepo!

13:22.480 --> 13:24.320
Pepo? Pepo!

13:24.370 --> 13:25.890
Hey, wait!

13:27.940 --> 13:28.590
Pepo!

13:29.220 --> 13:31.240
What are you doing so early in the morning?

13:32.370 --> 13:33.090
Nothing at all.

13:34.430 --> 13:34.820
Huh?

13:36.160 --> 13:37.680
Alright! Alright!

13:38.070 --> 13:38.910
Stop!

13:42.000 --> 13:42.930
That should do.

13:43.600 --> 13:45.330
Are you ready, Okame-chan?

13:47.200 --> 13:54.620
Hikarigaoka Nozomu
Accepting Valentine chocolates of love

13:47.200 --> 13:49.670
Well~ All you beautiful people out there!

13:50.130 --> 13:53.440
You may confess your love to me anyway you like!

13:55.100 --> 13:55.670
There, there...

13:56.020 --> 13:57.500
No need to panic and rush.

14:00.840 --> 14:02.690
Good morning, Hanakomachi-san!

14:02.850 --> 14:03.710
And she's gone...

14:04.310 --> 14:06.950
Ah, she's planning to give it to me alone later.

14:07.380 --> 14:08.360
Okay, okay...

14:08.790 --> 14:11.640
I accept hearts of shy ones like that too.

14:12.170 --> 14:12.460
Huh?

14:13.010 --> 14:13.900
Miyu-chi!

14:13.970 --> 14:15.420
Hey, I'm over here!

14:15.720 --> 14:16.700
She just left...

14:17.180 --> 14:17.780
Oh, I see.

14:18.170 --> 14:21.310
Since I'm so popular, I guess she's feeling jealous.

14:21.730 --> 14:24.020
Girls' feelings are so complicated...

14:29.780 --> 14:30.420
Miyu-chan.

14:30.800 --> 14:32.300
Ah. Good morning, Chris-chan.

14:32.950 --> 14:33.790
Where's Kanata-kun?

14:34.200 --> 14:36.330
Ah, I think he's arriving here soon.

14:36.730 --> 14:38.560
Ah! Saionji-kun!!!

14:39.650 --> 14:42.100
I made this for you, Saionji-kun!

14:42.220 --> 14:43.080
Me, too!

14:43.230 --> 14:43.830
This, too!

14:43.830 --> 14:44.230
This, too!

14:45.930 --> 14:47.440
Huh? Chris-chan?

14:49.620 --> 14:51.040
Oh! Chris-chan...

14:54.290 --> 14:56.040
Miyu, what are you doing?

14:56.290 --> 14:58.220
Ah, just a minute, Kanata...

15:03.540 --> 15:05.420
Ah! Chris-chan...

15:06.710 --> 15:07.710
Huh? What?

15:08.170 --> 15:09.660
Aren't you going to give me chocolate?

15:10.410 --> 15:13.820
Who would give any to someone like you?

15:23.440 --> 15:25.790
Kanata~ Did you get chocolates?

15:26.180 --> 15:27.620
Yeah... How about you, Santa?

15:27.950 --> 15:30.620
Oh no~! They keep coming!

15:30.830 --> 15:32.660
Ah, what's this feeling called?

15:32.980 --> 15:36.290
Love at first sight? A burning passion?

15:36.580 --> 15:39.570
Do you remember Akame-chan, my penpal?

15:40.250 --> 15:42.420
Ah... the student who studies in Germany?

15:43.590 --> 15:45.750
I got it this morning from her.

15:46.060 --> 15:48.180
Chocolates made in Germany!

15:48.860 --> 15:50.520
Ooh~ That sounds great.

15:50.520 --> 15:52.100
Not just that.

15:52.550 --> 15:54.670
The girls from the class have given me so many-

15:54.810 --> 15:56.820
Good morning, Saionji-kun~!

15:56.820 --> 15:57.700
Ah, thank you.

15:58.090 --> 15:59.890
Good morning, Kurosu-kun.

16:00.310 --> 16:01.440
Ah, thank you~

16:02.180 --> 16:04.720
Finally, looks like my time has come~

16:05.230 --> 16:08.860
Look... This is a shape that I totally dig!

16:10.190 --> 16:11.310
He looks really happy.

16:11.600 --> 16:13.840
One man's garbage is another's treasure, huh?

16:14.180 --> 16:16.240
That went well!

16:16.640 --> 16:18.580
Thank goodness he's happy~

16:21.720 --> 16:25.320
Chris-chan, why didn't you give the chocolates to Kanata?

16:25.920 --> 16:27.540
It's just... I felt so shy.

16:28.000 --> 16:30.150
Naturally, you've already given yours to Kanata-kun?

16:30.520 --> 16:31.400
Huh? Er...

16:33.000 --> 16:38.970
<i>I can't tell Chris-chan who helped me so much in making those chocolates that they were eaten up by Pepo...</i>

16:39.470 --> 16:42.570
I see... So you had the courage...

16:42.960 --> 16:43.490
It's nothing like that!

16:43.660 --> 16:45.740
For me, they were just obligatory chocolates.

16:47.220 --> 16:49.550
I'm totally hopeless.

16:50.260 --> 16:52.510
For me, these are anything but obligatory.

16:53.150 --> 16:54.070
It's alright.

16:54.140 --> 16:54.450
Huh?

16:54.630 --> 16:59.110
In return for helping me make the chocolate, I'll support you with all my might!

16:59.220 --> 16:59.460
Yeah!

16:59.460 --> 17:00.520
Do you mean it?

17:00.880 --> 17:01.830
What should we do?

17:02.070 --> 17:04.360
I'm getting <i>so excited</i>!

17:04.360 --> 17:07.150
Lunch Break

17:08.350 --> 17:09.030
What is it?

17:09.340 --> 17:10.540
Just come with me for a bit.

17:15.740 --> 17:17.200
Are you prepared, Chris-chan?

17:17.580 --> 17:19.300
O-okay. But-

17:19.510 --> 17:21.720
What are you saying? Don't look back.

17:22.220 --> 17:22.590
Go!

17:31.560 --> 17:32.410
M-Miyu-chan...

17:36.460 --> 17:39.780
Kanata-kun! Um- good day.

17:40.670 --> 17:41.470
Chris-chan...

17:42.280 --> 17:42.850
You can do it!

17:43.060 --> 17:43.300
Yes, Ma'am!

17:45.630 --> 17:46.200
Here!

17:46.300 --> 17:49.940
These are the pumpkin and chocolate flavored rice cakes that I made.

17:50.570 --> 17:53.040
I hope it suits your taste.

17:53.460 --> 17:54.660
Uh... for me?

17:56.200 --> 17:56.680
Thank you.

17:57.220 --> 17:58.430
You're welcome.

17:58.820 --> 18:01.050
Whew... She finally handed it over.

18:07.680 --> 18:08.460
Awkward.

18:11.550 --> 18:12.250
Here, take this.

18:12.630 --> 18:13.930
What's this?

18:14.190 --> 18:15.330
Valentine's chocolate.

18:15.750 --> 18:16.110
Huh?

18:16.600 --> 18:20.060
I thought of giving it to the person who was in charge before...

18:20.620 --> 18:22.530
....but I don't know where he went.

18:22.930 --> 18:25.070
Thank you very much, I'll take this.

18:25.170 --> 18:29.760
But, since we're both women... Valentine's kinda in vain, isn't it?

18:36.450 --> 18:37.340
Ah!

18:37.520 --> 18:38.430
Nanami-chan!

18:38.500 --> 18:40.880
Ssh! Aya's in a dramatic situation right now.

18:46.030 --> 18:47.550
Could this be...

18:47.990 --> 18:50.950
Uh, how to put it... That's to say, um...

18:51.170 --> 18:52.980
It's the start of a new play!

18:53.250 --> 18:53.800
Right!

18:53.970 --> 18:55.470
The new production is on it's way!

18:55.650 --> 18:57.440
Uh, it's not that.

18:57.800 --> 19:01.160
I don't know since when I began to get serious-

19:01.160 --> 19:03.620
No way! I'm a big fan of yours, Konishi-san!

19:03.790 --> 19:05.660
Let's give it our best shot!

19:05.870 --> 19:07.920
Thank you! Let's do our best~

19:08.060 --> 19:09.440
But that's not it...

19:09.650 --> 19:11.830
This is Valentine's chocolates!

19:12.650 --> 19:13.630
Valentine?

19:13.850 --> 19:16.280
That means the new production is a love story?

19:16.530 --> 19:17.300
Ah, right, that's right.

19:17.300 --> 19:20.580
Ah, no, I think I'll need backup for this.

19:21.100 --> 19:23.600
Aya sure seems to be having an interesting time...

19:24.020 --> 19:26.550
But somehow, they might make a good pair.

19:26.980 --> 19:29.010
Alright! It's my turn next!

19:29.360 --> 19:31.020
I'm all hyped up!

19:36.260 --> 19:36.720
Okay!

19:39.460 --> 19:41.790
No way... I can't do it!

19:42.130 --> 19:44.040
What are you saying, Nanami-chan?

19:44.390 --> 19:46.610
What goes for women, goes for men.

19:46.960 --> 19:49.360
Now, get going!

19:54.810 --> 19:55.360
Welcome.

19:55.710 --> 19:56.520
On the way from school?

19:56.900 --> 19:58.790
Y-Yes! That's right.

19:59.410 --> 20:01.970
I left a dress that Nanami-chan might like.

20:02.420 --> 20:04.980
What? Ah... But today it's fine.

20:05.310 --> 20:05.620
I see.

20:06.150 --> 20:07.320
Well, take your time and see.

20:07.840 --> 20:08.850
Okay~

20:15.040 --> 20:15.840
Tsukishima-san...

20:17.640 --> 20:18.140
What?

20:19.150 --> 20:22.640
Um! These are Valentine chocolates...

20:23.220 --> 20:24.490
Huh? For me?

20:25.360 --> 20:29.380
Um... Do you have a girlfriend?

20:34.400 --> 20:35.780
That's fine!

20:36.270 --> 20:38.280
But please accept this.

20:38.640 --> 20:42.550
It's not <i>sasakamaboko</i>, but surfboard-shaped cookies.

20:43.130 --> 20:43.550
Thank you.

20:47.520 --> 20:48.580
That went well...

20:51.540 --> 20:57.220
I'm feeling somewhat depressed.

21:09.140 --> 21:10.980
As expected, it's too crowded here...

21:11.440 --> 21:15.070
But I'm a girl and I'm not about to let something like this put me off!

21:24.600 --> 21:25.570
I'm home...

21:26.160 --> 21:28.190
What happened, Miyu-san?

21:28.590 --> 21:30.890
This and that... I'm tired.

21:31.710 --> 21:34.510
I got chocolate from your mother.

21:34.770 --> 21:36.080
What?! From Mama?

21:36.640 --> 21:41.280
"The ever-popular Kanata-kun must have received a lot of chocolates..."

21:41.740 --> 21:45.090
"Here's one more present from Hitomi-chan and me."

21:45.760 --> 21:52.360
In place of his late mother, Miyu-san's mother has sent him chocolates, right?

21:54.090 --> 21:56.500
Even Mama's gotten all enthusiastic about it...

21:57.000 --> 21:57.730
Pepo!

21:57.780 --> 21:58.560
Ah, Pepo!

21:59.190 --> 22:00.610
You can't eat that.

22:03.890 --> 22:05.010
I guess it can't be helped.

22:05.510 --> 22:07.450
Since it's kind of pitiful, I wonder if I should give it?

22:08.260 --> 22:09.220
This is for you, Wannya.

22:09.770 --> 22:12.990
These are <i>mitarashi dango</i>-shaped chocolates, right?

22:12.990 --> 22:14.780
Thank you...

22:15.410 --> 22:16.900
This is for Ruu-kun and Pepo.

22:17.640 --> 22:19.050
You must not eat it at one go.

22:22.570 --> 22:23.330
And then...

22:26.040 --> 22:28.540
Y-you don't have to read anything into this.

22:28.960 --> 22:30.480
It's like obligatory chocolate.

22:30.800 --> 22:35.840
I thought it'd be too pitiful if you were the only one who didn't get any.

22:36.900 --> 22:41.240
But since it seems you've got some from here and there, maybe this is totally unnecessary.

22:43.700 --> 22:43.940
Here.

22:44.710 --> 22:45.940
Oh, thank you.

22:47.430 --> 22:48.300
May I open it?

22:48.800 --> 22:49.880
Huh? Sure.

22:51.780 --> 22:54.530
Looks delicious, doesn't it?

23:00.990 --> 23:02.440
<i>Wannya's childcare journal:</i>

23:02.890 --> 23:09.420
<i>Today's Valentine's Day, when girls give chocolates to boys they like.</i>

23:10.190 --> 23:13.230
<i>Ruu-chama and I received chocolates.</i>

23:13.790 --> 23:16.760
<i>Something like this is wonderful at times, isn't it?</i>

23:19.950 --> 23:24.770
Motto tanoshii koto ga

23:19.950 --> 23:24.770
I felt that everyday

23:25.410 --> 23:28.400
afureru mainichi

23:25.410 --> 23:28.400
more fun-filled days

23:29.200 --> 23:33.530
matteru kigashita

23:29.200 --> 23:33.530
were waiting ahead

23:35.380 --> 23:42.880
datte kimi to mata aeta kara

23:35.380 --> 23:42.880
because I was able to meet you again

23:42.970 --> 23:48.700
Nee ima wa aserazu

23:42.970 --> 23:48.700
Hey, now, without being in a rush

23:49.890 --> 23:53.260
Yukkuri aruite

23:49.890 --> 23:53.260
Walk slowly

23:53.560 --> 23:57.050
Takusan waratte

23:53.560 --> 23:57.050
Laugh a lot

23:57.320 --> 24:01.390
Soshite nanika wo mitsuketara

23:57.320 --> 24:01.390
And when you find something

24:01.620 --> 24:04.980
daiji ni shiyou

24:01.620 --> 24:04.980
let's cherish it

24:05.450 --> 24:08.650
mata aeta ne

24:05.450 --> 24:08.650
until we meet again

24:09.200 --> 24:14.700
Issho ni iyou

24:09.200 --> 24:14.700
Let's stay together

24:22.140 --> 24:29.960
The End

24:29.960 --> 25:00.040
Next Episode

24:31.440 --> 24:35.690
What we're doing for the culture festival will be an all out musical?

24:35.800 --> 24:37.350
They'd need Ruu to play in it again?!

24:37.520 --> 24:41.060
The story is just like the one where we met Ruu-kun!

24:41.060 --> 24:43.490
What?! Ruu-chama's UFO beacon has gotten through!

24:43.490 --> 24:46.550
Next on Daa! Daa! Daa!: Cultural Festival with Ruu-kun in the leading role.

24:47.420 --> 24:48.700
Mama is in a faraway universe?

24:48.720 --> 24:50.620
Um... Miyu-san, Kanata-san...

24:50.750 --> 24:51.810
What's the matter, Wannya?

24:51.890 --> 24:53.890
A rescue party from Planet Otto has responded?!

24:54.100 --> 24:55.340
Mama! Papa!

24:55.430 --> 24:55.880
Pepo?
